{"id": "34331", "title": "青梅戏竹马", "author": "碧洛", "category": "文学名著", "count": 45, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/34/34331.htm", "intro": "一条印花手帕，开始“他跑她追的”的爱情戏，而如今已经轰动商界、惊动美人窝的他，让她的爱情追逐战更加艰辛，像现在，才刚摆脱一个易碎的唐瓷娃娃，又得跟一个“哺乳类保母”大战三百回合，只是在好几次灯光美、气氛佳的情况下，他就是绝口、闭口、住口不提“爱”字，教她只好下猛药，启蒙他这个“情障”者…… 怎跟他设计的重逢画面完全不一样？分别十年，那自小跟在后面的“小哈巴狗”，见了面却理都不理他，更气那只“法国苍蝇”老是黏在她身边，而报上那则企业联姻的消息更是个大震撼，她要结婚了，新郎竟然不是他！她怎可在倒追他二十一年后轻言放弃？但他可没忘了那承诺一当她的白马王子，请密切潢意，白马王子来抢亲了……", "base": "files/article/html/34/34331", "chapters": [{"title": "序言", "file": "2181806.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第1页", "file": "2181807.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第2页", "file": "2181808.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第3页", "file": "2181809.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第4页", "file": "2181810.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第5页", "file": "2181811.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第6页", "file": "2181812.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第7页", "file": "2181813.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第8页", "file": "2181814.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第9页", "file": "2181815.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第10页", "file": "2181816.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第11页", "file": "2181817.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第12页", "file": "2181818.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第13页", "file": "2181819.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第14页", "file": "2181820.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第15页", "file": "2181821.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第16页", "file": "2181822.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第17页", "file": "2181823.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第18页", "file": "2181824.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第19页", "file": "2181825.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第20页", "file": "2181826.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第21页", "file": "2181827.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第22页", "file": "2181828.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第23页", "file": "21